graph LR
    A[Client sends file as base64 JSON] --> B[Authorizer checks key in api-keys table]
    B --> C[apiHandler writes object to S3 with documentid metadata]
    C --> D[apiHandler writes record: status UPLOADED]
    D --> E[S3 ObjectCreated event]
    E --> F[documentProcessor reads object metadata]
    F --> G[Record updated: status PROCESSED]
    F -.->|fails after 2 retries| H[Dead-letter queue]
